19.3 **Consequences of Force Majeure**: If a Force Majeure event occurs, the affected party’s performance under this Agreement shall be suspended for the duration of the Force Majeure event. The parties shall use commercially reasonable efforts to mitigate the impact of the Force Majeure event and to resume performance as soon as possible.

